            <ArticleTitle>[Metabolism of several blood prostaglandins in patients with angina pectoris during helium-neon laser therapy].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>12-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The paper shows the high therapeutical efficiency of combined He-Ne laser therapy in patients with coronary heart disease. Its effect on the thromboxane-prostacyclin system is one of the mechanisms of laser impact. The combined He-Ne laser therapy promotes normalization of the level of thromboxane B2 and its ratio to the metabolite prostacyclin.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
